{"format":"nexus-update-v1","version":"2.0.0","notes":"Nexus 2.0: the orb can see your screen (turn on the eye), a screenshot hotkey (Ctrl+Alt+S), a task queue for overnight work, phone approvals over your Wi-Fi (scan a QR code), one-click Undo task, Save to vault on any answer, Ctrl+K search that jumps to the message, new Roblox games from a template, Gemini as a third AI, and \"Hey Nexus\" voice wake-up.","payload":"","signature":"SoakRLuVjNHhR504/ZhncHLdE9+JPwsTwam3zbV+aI5pVn/ObTd7pW695o67w/Gn54KcLbwtD0Yp02wVoFgCAA=="}